# Extensions you install yourself stay out of git (and survive panel updates).
# Only the guide and SDKs are tracked. The starter templates are NOT shipped
# with the panel: they're downloads on https://docs.flutter.software/extensions/templates
# (source lives in the Flutter-Docs repo under templates/extensions/).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/flutter-sdk.d.ts
!/_sdk/

# Build caches.
target/
node_modules/
